crates/crashes: no minidumps on MikuOS.

crash-handler and minidumper (ptrace, minidump-writer) leave the MikuOS
build; src/lib.rs picks upstream's crashes.rs or src/miku.rs, which has the
same API. An unhandled fault gets the kernel's report instead.

